   "text": "AI-powered competitive analysis, built on real strategy frameworks.\n\nFieldbrief turns a company name into a cited strategy report in minutes.\nAI agents research the company and its competitors, then apply proven\nframeworks to derive a SWOT and recommendations.",
   "originalText": "AI-powered competitive analysis, built on real strategy frameworks.\n\nFieldbrief turns a company name into a cited strategy report in minutes.\nAI agents research the company and its competitors, then apply proven\nframeworks to derive a SWOT and recommendations.",
