   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Analyze company -> cited, framework-based report\n- Confirm / edit company and competitors\n- Track analysis progress live\n- Export & revisit reports (PDF / JSON)\n\nOut of scope:\n- Private data sourcing\n- Chat with report\n- Customize report sections",
   "originalText": "- Analyze company -> cited, framework-based report\n- Confirm / edit company and competitors\n- Track analysis progress live\n- Export & revisit reports (PDF / JSON)\n\nOut of scope:\n- Private data sourcing\n- Chat with report\n- Customize report sections",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
