  {
   "id": "t9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1903.1355222280672,
   "y": 795.277610205947,
   "width": 803.0000000000001,
   "height": 350,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 64427653,
   "version": 177,
   "versionNonce": 2029250966,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792584397639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Resolve: query -> candidates (Wikidata, aliases) -> user confirms\n- Speculative start: research target + likely competitors right away\n- Competitors: graph lookup, else discover -> user edits -> job queued\n- Plan: find stale/missing claims per company X field\n- Research: fan out per company X field; fetch (dedup by URL/hash)\n      -> extract claims for all known companies on the page\n- Validate: verify against snippets, score confidence;\n      retry gaps (capped)\n- Analyze: per company as soon as its research is done (pipelined)\n- Synthesize: SWOT + recommendations linked to claims (waits for all)\n- Deliver: save report + report_claims (done / partial),\n      sections streamed as they are ready\n\nRefresh -> starts at Plan.  Cost + time budget checked at every LLM call.",
   "originalText": "- Resolve: query -> candidates (Wikidata, aliases) -> user confirms\n- Speculative start: research target + likely competitors right away\n- Competitors: graph lookup, else discover -> user edits -> job queued\n- Plan: find stale/missing claims per company X field\n- Research: fan out per company X field; fetch (dedup by URL/hash)\n      -> extract claims for all known companies on the page\n- Validate: verify against snippets, score confidence;\n      retry gaps (capped)\n- Analyze: per company as soon as its research is done (pipelined)\n- Synthesize: SWOT + recommendations linked to claims (waits for all)\n- Deliver: save report + report_claims (done / partial),\n      sections streamed as they are ready\n\nRefresh -> starts at Plan.  Cost + time budget checked at every LLM call.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "index": "b2zzzzwV",
   "created": null,
   "labelPosition": null,
   "baseFontSize": null
  },
  {
