   "text": "- User\n- Company\n- Report\n- Claim\n- Source\n\nRelationships:\n- User 1 -- * Report\n- Report -> target Company + competitor Companies\n- Report -> Claims (evidence used)\n- Claim -> Company + Source (relevance, confidence)\n- Company * -- * Company (competitor graph)",
   "originalText": "- User\n- Company\n- Report\n- Claim\n- Source\n\nRelationships:\n- User 1 -- * Report\n- Report -> target Company + competitor Companies\n- Report -> Claims (evidence used)\n- Claim -> Company + Source (relevance, confidence)\n- Company * -- * Company (competitor graph)",
