   "updated": 1792584397639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "USERS\n  id                 uuid PK\n  email              string UK\n  created_at         timestamp\n\nCOMPANIES\n  id                 uuid PK\n  name               string\n  aliases            text[]\n  domain             string UK\n  ticker             string\n  cik                string\n  industry           string\n\nCOMPANY_COMPETITORS\n  company_id         uuid PK, FK -> companies\n  competitor_id      uuid PK, FK -> companies\n  relevance          float\n  origin             enum (discovered, user)\n  updated_at         timestamp\n\nSOURCES\n  id                 uuid PK\n  url                string UK\n  title              string\n  source_type        enum (filing, official, news, blog)\n  published_at       timestamp\n  fetched_at         timestamp\n  content_hash       string\n\nCLAIMS\n  id                 uuid PK\n  company_id         uuid FK -> companies\n  source_id          uuid FK -> sources\n  field              string\n  statement          text\n  value              jsonb\n  snippet            text\n  relevance          float\n  verified           bool\n  extracted_at       timestamp\n\nREPORTS\n  id                 uuid PK\n  user_id            uuid FK -> users\n  target_company_id  uuid FK -> companies\n  parent_report_id   uuid FK -> reports\n  tier               enum (quick, standard, deep)\n  status             enum (queued, running, done, partial, failed)\n  report_json        jsonb\n  cost_usd           numeric\n  created_at         timestamp\n  completed_at       timestamp\n\nREPORT_COMPETITORS\n  report_id          uuid PK, FK -> reports\n  company_id         uuid PK, FK -> companies\n\nREPORT_CLAIMS\n  report_id          uuid PK, FK -> reports\n  claim_id           uuid PK, FK -> claims",
