   "updated": 1792584397636,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Orchestrated, not choreographed: one LangGraph per report\n- RabbitMQ, not Kafka: durable per-job ack, retry, priorities\n- Stateless nodes pass IDs: any stage can become a service later\n- Latency: cache, speculative start, pipelining, timeouts\n- Web content is untrusted: strict-schema extraction only\n- Reliability: checkpoint resume, idempotency keys\n- Scale path: SQS, Temporal, shard by company_id",
   "originalText": "- Orchestrated, not choreographed: one LangGraph per report\n- RabbitMQ, not Kafka: durable per-job ack, retry, priorities\n- Stateless nodes pass IDs: any stage can become a service later\n- Latency: cache, speculative start, pipelining, timeouts\n- Web content is untrusted: strict-schema extraction only\n- Reliability: checkpoint resume, idempotency keys\n- Scale path: SQS, Temporal, shard by company_id",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
