   "locked": false,
   "text": "API        nginx + FastAPI\nUI         Jinja2 + HTMX\nAgents     LangGraph + Postgres checkpoints\nLLM        LiteLLM -> provider API  ($)\nData       Postgres (data + research cache)\nQueue      RabbitMQ + FastStream (jobs, progress)\nSearch     SearXNG, httpx + trafilatura\nSources    SEC EDGAR, Wikidata\nPDF        Playwright\nTracing    Langfuse (self-hosted)\nRun        docker compose\nOptional   Ollama for extraction",
   "originalText": "API        nginx + FastAPI\nUI         Jinja2 + HTMX\nAgents     LangGraph + Postgres checkpoints\nLLM        LiteLLM -> provider API  ($)\nData       Postgres (data + research cache)\nQueue      RabbitMQ + FastStream (jobs, progress)\nSearch     SearXNG, httpx + trafilatura\nSources    SEC EDGAR, Wikidata\nPDF        Playwright\nTracing    Langfuse (self-hosted)\nRun        docker compose\nOptional   Ollama for extraction",
