   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792584661714,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "0. Design: fields, report schema, frameworks, agent graph, evals\n1. Skeleton: repo, compose, migrations, CI, CLI\n2. Access: fetch layer, EDGAR, Wikidata, LLM gateway\n3. Thin slice: one company -> cited JSON report\n4. Competitors + frameworks -> full report from CLI\n5. Evals: golden set, tune to NFRs\n6. Service: API, queue, worker, SSE\n7. UI + PDF\n8. Ship: README, design doc, demo",
   "originalText": "0. Design: fields, report schema, frameworks, agent graph, evals\n1. Skeleton: repo, compose, migrations, CI, CLI\n2. Access: fetch layer, EDGAR, Wikidata, LLM gateway\n3. Thin slice: one company -> cited JSON report\n4. Competitors + frameworks -> full report from CLI\n5. Evals: golden set, tune to NFRs\n6. Service: API, queue, worker, SSE\n7. UI + PDF\n8. Ship: README, design doc, demo",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
