   "updated": 1792584671222,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Field                      Holds                                   Feeds              Tier  T/C\nprofile.description        what the company does                   overview           Q     T,C\nprofile.hq_founded         HQ, founding year                       overview           Q     T,C\nprofile.employees          headcount                               scale, position    Q     T,C\noffering.products          main products/services                  BMC, position      Q     T,C\ncustomers.segments         who buys                                BMC, position      Q     T,C\nrevenue.model              how it makes money                      BMC                Q     T,C\nfinancials.revenue         latest revenue + growth                 snapshot           Q     T,C\nevents.recent              key news, last 12 months                SWOT (O/T)         Q     T\npricing.model              price points, tiers, free plan          position, 5F       S     T,C\noffering.value_prop        claimed differentiation                 BMC, VRIO          S     T,C\nchannels.go_to_market      sales motion                            BMC                S     T\nfinancials.profitability   margins / net income / burn             snapshot, SWOT     S     T\nfinancials.funding_or_cap  funding (private) / market cap          snapshot           S     T,C\nresources.advantages       brand, IP, network fx, data, lock-in    VRIO               S     T\nmarket.forces              buyers, suppliers, substitutes, entry   Five Forces        S     T\nenvironment.regulation     relevant regulation                     PESTEL-lite (T)    S     T\nmarket.size_growth         market size, growth                     Opportunities      D     T\npartners.key               key partners / suppliers                BMC                D     T\nstrategy.moves             M&A, expansions, launches               SWOT, recs         D     T,C\nrisks.disclosed            risk factors (10-K)                     Threats            D     T\n\nTiers cumulative (Q < S < D). T = target, C = competitor (light subset).\nRules: \"not found\" after N tries is a stored unknown claim (no endless retries).\nFreshness: events ~7d, financials until next filing, everything else 30d.",
   "originalText": "Field                      Holds                                   Feeds              Tier  T/C\nprofile.description        what the company does                   overview           Q     T,C\nprofile.hq_founded         HQ, founding year                       overview           Q     T,C\nprofile.employees          headcount                               scale, position    Q     T,C\noffering.products          main products/services                  BMC, position      Q     T,C\ncustomers.segments         who buys                                BMC, position      Q     T,C\nrevenue.model              how it makes money                      BMC                Q     T,C\nfinancials.revenue         latest revenue + growth                 snapshot           Q     T,C\nevents.recent              key news, last 12 months                SWOT (O/T)         Q     T\npricing.model              price points, tiers, free plan          position, 5F       S     T,C\noffering.value_prop        claimed differentiation                 BMC, VRIO          S     T,C\nchannels.go_to_market      sales motion                            BMC                S     T\nfinancials.profitability   margins / net income / burn             snapshot, SWOT     S     T\nfinancials.funding_or_cap  funding (private) / market cap          snapshot           S     T,C\nresources.advantages       brand, IP, network fx, data, lock-in    VRIO               S     T\nmarket.forces              buyers, suppliers, substitutes, entry   Five Forces        S     T\nenvironment.regulation     relevant regulation                     PESTEL-lite (T)    S     T\nmarket.size_growth         market size, growth                     Opportunities      D     T\npartners.key               key partners / suppliers                BMC                D     T\nstrategy.moves             M&A, expansions, launches               SWOT, recs         D     T,C\nrisks.disclosed            risk factors (10-K)                     Threats            D     T\n\nTiers cumulative (Q < S < D). T = target, C = competitor (light subset).\nRules: \"not found\" after N tries is a stored unknown claim (no endless retries).\nFreshness: events ~7d, financials until next filing, everything else 30d.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
